    narr:narration """On July 17, 2026, the organization initiated a transition of its analytics infrastructure, moving from PostgreSQL to [QuantumDB](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1784281647281_1). This [migration](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1784281647281_3) is framed by the principal actor as a strategic shift driven by [performance and cost considerations](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1784281647281_2). The technical justification centers on an anticipated [10x improvement](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1784281647281_4) in analytical query speeds, alongside a reduction in licensing overhead. The execution is currently scheduled for [Q3 2026](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1784281647281_5), establishing a concrete timeline for the shift.""" ;
